  "source_detail": "PLAN.md Q3",
  "explanation": "The same question goes through one of three shapes; the recommendation is [asking every router at once](#fanout). Look at where each shape can go wrong: [walking down from the top](#walk) can take a wrong turn early, and [one big multiple-choice question](#onelist) runs out of room in a large repo. Leaves out the confidence threshold and the not-confident fallback, which are already decided.",
